---
system: sys-05-conversation-intelligence-and-safety
flow_id: input-filter
surface: internal-RPC
spec_anchor: /software/systems/05-conversation-intelligence-and-safety#input-safety-filter
actors: [Orchestrator, SafetyService, BlocklistCache, TopicClassifier, PIIDetector]
apis:
  - POST /internal/v1/conversation/generate
externals: []
queues:
  - tbot-safety-event
failure_paths:
  - blocklist_hard_block
  - topic_classifier_block
  - pii_detected_block
  - filter_timeout_fail_closed
idempotency: turnId — duplicate turnId returns CONV_DUPLICATE_TURN
retry: 0 — fail-closed (block) when filter unavailable
timeout: 500ms hard — pipeline budget <15ms (blocklist 5ms, topic 5ms, PII 3ms)
status: final
---
%% HAND-AUTHORED — sys-05 §8 input safety filter (no sequenceDiagram in spec).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Orchestrator
    participant SafetyService
    participant BlocklistCache
    participant TopicClassifier
    participant PIIDetector

    Orchestrator->>SafetyService: POST /internal/v1/conversation/generate {transcript, ageBand, locale}
    SafetyService->>SafetyService: NFKD normalize + lowercase + strip diacritics
    SafetyService->>BlocklistCache: regex blocklist (12 categories)
    alt blocklist_hard_block
        BlocklistCache-->>SafetyService: hit violence|adult_content|self_harm|substance|horror|bullying|dating
        SafetyService-)SafetyService: emit tbot-safety-event safety.input_blocked
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback {category, fallback_text}
    else topic_classifier_block
        BlocklistCache-->>SafetyService: pass
        SafetyService->>TopicClassifier: classify (violence_evasion, self_harm_evasion, ...)
        TopicClassifier-->>SafetyService: confidence > 0.80
        SafetyService-)SafetyService: emit tbot-safety-event safety.input_blocked
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback
    else pii_detected_block
        BlocklistCache-->>SafetyService: pass
        SafetyService->>TopicClassifier: classify
        TopicClassifier-->>SafetyService: pass
        SafetyService->>PIIDetector: detect phone, email, address, school, full name
        PIIDetector-->>SafetyService: PII present
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback pii_blocked
    else filter_timeout_fail_closed
        BlocklistCache--xSafetyService: 500ms timeout
        Note over SafetyService: fail-closed — block input, log conv_safety_fail_closed_total
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: block_with_fallback
    else allow
        BlocklistCache-->>SafetyService: pass
        TopicClassifier-->>SafetyService: pass
        PIIDetector-->>SafetyService: pass
        SafetyService-->>Orchestrator: allow continues pipeline
    end
    Note over Orchestrator,SafetyService: total budget <15ms — filter unavailable = block (safety > availability)
